Retrieve a list of MessageQ deployments.

USAGE:
  scw messageq deployment list [arg=value ...]

ARGS:
  [project-id]        Project ID to filter for, only deployments from this Project will be returned
  [order-by]          Sort order for deployments in the response (created_at_asc | created_at_desc | name_asc | name_desc | updated_at_asc | updated_at_desc)
  [tags.{index}]      Tags to filter for, only deployments with one or more matching tags will be returned
  [name]              Deployment name to filter for, only deployments with this string within their name will be returned
  [organization-id]   Organization ID to filter for, only deployments from this Organization will be returned
  [region=fr-par]     Region to target. If none is passed will use default region from the config (fr-par | all)

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for list
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use
